silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_02_enrichment_by_type_information_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'EnrichmentAnchorVetRecord77ToMittens', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The veterinary record olog object whose hom-set into Mittens contains exactly one typed arrow: \"about\". This is the concrete example that makes the Set-enrichment claim tangible: one vet record, one \"about\" arrow, one hom-set element.." .
